279","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangsu","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangsu:p001","quote":"素字休業，彬五世孫而逡之族子也。高祖翹之，晉光祿大夫。曾祖望之、祖泰之，並不仕。父元弘，位平固令。素少有志行，家貧母老，隱居不仕。宋孝建、大明、泰始中，屢征不就，聲譽甚高。山中有蚿聲清長，聽之使人不厭，而其形甚醜，素乃爲蚿賦以自況。卒年五十四。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangsu:p001:m0049","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangsu:p001:m0057","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangsu:p001","surface":"家貧母老","start":55,"end":59}}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"母指休業之母，兩書均未載姓名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-nanshi024-wangsu-m-mother","subject_person_id":"x90_vgz_2uf_AAAA","object_person_id":"916_z0f_u2a","predicate":"mother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"家貧母老","nanshi024_wangsu_reading":"m-mother"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-093","source_id":"s-songshu-093-wangsu-ws1962755","chapter_id":"c-songshu-093-wangsu","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-093-wangsu:p002","quote":"素少有志行，家貧母老。初爲廬陵國侍郎，母憂去職。服闋，廬陵王紹爲江州，親舊勸素修完舊居，素不答，乃輕身往東陽，隱居不仕，頗營田園之資，得以自立。愛好文義，不以人俗累懷。世祖即位，欲搜揚隱退，下詔曰：「濟世成務，咸達隱微，軌俗興讓，必表淸節。朕昧旦求善，思惇薄風，琅邪王素、會稽朱百年，並廉約貞遠，與物無競，自足臯畝，志在不移。宜加褒引，以光難進。並可太子舍人。」大明中，太宰江夏王義恭開府辟召，辟素爲倉曹屬，太宗泰始六年，又召爲太子中舍人，並不就。素既屢被徴辟，聲譽甚髙。山中有蚿蟲，聲淸長，聽之使人不厭，而其形甚醜，素乃爲蚿賦以自況。七年，卒，時年五十四。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-093-wangsu:p002:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-093-wangsu:p002:m0008","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-songshu-093-wangsu:p002","surface":"家貧母老","start":6,"end":10}}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"母指休業之母，兩書均未載姓名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-nanshi024-wangsu-mother","person_id":"916_z0f_u2a","event_type":"death","source_term":"母憂","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-songshu-093-wangsu:p002","surface":"母憂","start":19,"end":21},"da